<title>CANADA: Revenue plans IPO for Pan Pacific unit.</title>
<headline>Revenue plans IPO for Pan Pacific unit.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revenue Properties Company Ltd said on Monday that its Pan Pacific Retail Properties U.S. unit filed with regulators for an initial public offering of about 6.6 million shares, expected to raise about US$130 million..</p>
</text>
